<%# locals: heading, resolver ('bg'/'text'), utility (e.g. 'bg--{token}'), example %>
<div class="space-y-4">
  <%= framework_heading(4, heading) %>
  <p class="<%= framework_section_description_classes %>">
    The <code class="<%= framework_section_code_classes %>"><%= resolver %>(token, { el })</code> resolver returns
    the exact paint a <code class="<%= framework_section_code_classes %>"><%= utility %></code> utility would apply,
    as a canonical Fill read from the live cascade with bit depth, dark mode, and theme resolved. Apply it to
    canvases, SVGs, or chart options. See <%= render DocsRef.new(page: :paint_colors) %> for every resolver and the
    Fill shape.
  </p>
  <%= render CodeExampleComponent.new(demo_code: example, language: 'javascript') %>
</div>
